{:strongs 5162, :hebrew "נחם", :lang :zh-Hans, :gloss "properly, to sigh, i.e. breathe strongly; by implication, to be sorry, i.e. (in a favorable sense) to pity, console or (reflexively) rue; or (unfavorably) to avenge (oneself)", :text "本义为叹息，即急促地呼吸；引申为懊悔，即（褒义）怜悯、安慰，或（反身用法）自悔；（贬义）则指（为自己）复仇。", :model "glm-5.2", :timestamp "2026-07-27T02:02:38.555402359Z"}